<p dir="ltr">Ya garib ya hussain - 4</p>

<p dir="ltr">Haye mera veer hussain - 6<br />
Shabbir de laashe te zainab ne haye ro ro paaya bayn</p>

<p dir="ltr">1. Shabbir bhira teri laashotte mai aayi rasiya paake<br />
Tere kaatal laash chudaiye naize diya darba laake<br />
Nai turdiya inj behna laash utta jive tur payi teri behn</p>

<p dir="ltr">2. Ek hath nal tere qaatil ne tera sir zulfa to chaya<br />
Duje hathwich mera burkacha menu zaalim aan wakhaya<br />
Is zulm de manzar ne balde wich mere maar dite sab chayn</p>

<p dir="ltr">3.ban shahid tere sajde di rayi manzar ro ro takdi<br />
Jado gal tere te gal rakhke rayi maa zehra tur raandi<br />
Pyaasa ayla mayi haye zaalim ku ae mera nure ayn</p>

<p dir="ltr">4. Hasrat hayi kafan pava vandi nal soni kabr banesa<br />
Par shaam da safar jado sunya muk gaiyya saariya wasa<br />
Teri nagri wich veeran hai zaalim nahi dende menu rehn</p>

<p dir="ltr">5.wich shaam wale bazar veeran jeda waqt namaz da raave<br />
Bas yaad rakhi inj wekhi tu mere wich bazaar de sajde<br />
Jive sattar qadam te mai wekhan rayi teri khanjar tale zohrain</p>

<p dir="ltr">6. Meku aan sakina aankhdi hayi koi zaalim shimr nu aakhe<br />
Mai baksh diyangi dur oku jede zulm de naal lahaye<br />
Kuch der layeen meku babedi mayyat te deve bayn</p>

<p dir="ltr">7. Nahi john ae matam ruk sagda ae roze hashar tayi jaari<br />
Kyunke turbat wich ro roke di zehra darda maari<br />
Payi wen kalendiye aj taayi meri shaam di malka sen</p>

<p dir="ltr">Ya garib ya hussain - 4</p>
</p>